Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(eval): isolate the external metering checkpoint from
 the subject

Chmod the temporary snapshot before rename so a host racing the publish
sees 0644. Recover only a bounded regular file so a symlink or a large
write cannot become usage evidence.

Fixes #3149
