Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(eval): authenticate the metering checkpoint with the
 relay result token

Sign the snapshot with HMAC-SHA256 of the host-issued result token so a
subject cannot replace the file with schema-valid JSON. Recovery rejects
unsigned, tampered, and wrong-secret files. Also add the missing newline
that failed format:check.
